# Google Cloud Translation API key (single line).
# Create at: https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
# Enable "Cloud Translation API" on the project first.
#
# Copy to Scripts/google_translate_api_key (gitignored):
#   cp Scripts/google_translate_api_key.example Scripts/google_translate_api_key
#   # then paste your key as the only line
#
# Or: export GOOGLE_TRANSLATE_API_KEY=YOUR_KEY
YOUR_GOOGLE_CLOUD_TRANSLATION_API_KEY
